            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"workers-with-the-most-errors-and-disconnects\">Workers with the most errors and disconnects</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The bellow code fetches errors and disconnects for both the top workers with most errors,\nas well as the top workers with the most disconnects.</span></span>"
