          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"workers-with-the-highest-average-cpu-times\">Workers with the highest average CPU times</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Note: This query only fetches the 50th quantile of CPU times, but other quantiles, such as <code>cpuTimeP90</code>,\n<code>cpuTimeP99</code> and <code>cpuTimeP999</code> can also be queried by adding these columns in the <code>quantiles {}</code> field.</span></span>"
